# UV: AutoUV, Unwrap and Layout on a Lat Long sphere preview a checker until Accept; each accepted result shows even, unstretched squares
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,170,260
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.3,-0.95
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.Radius 60
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape sphere: Lat Long"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,40,0
Когда run Modeling "UV tool: AutoUV"
Тогда-вид 0_autouv checker squares over the sphere, roughly even in size, no long stretched strips
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда run Modeling "UV tool: Unwrap"
Тогда-вид 1_unwrap checker of the unwrapped islands, squares even in size across the visible surface
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда run Modeling "UV tool: Layout"
Тогда 2_layout checker after the repack, squares even; tool bar UV Layout with Accept and Cancel
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда-вид 3_accepted no tool bar, the sphere drawn with its material again
